BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kea-ioulida-pentecost-panigiri-ioulida-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270619
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270621
SUMMARY:Pentecost panigiri\, Ioulida
LOCATION:Ioulida\, Kea (Tzia)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The municipality's 'traditional Agiou Pnevmatos panigiri' in Ioulida on the evening of Pentecost Sunday from 21:00 — an island glenti in the main square with live violin and laouto and Tziotiko dancing\, the first big night of the Kea summer. It coincides with the three-day Pentecost weekend when Athenians pour onto the island\, so book the Lavrio ferry and your room well ahead.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kea/#ioulida-pentecost-panigiri-ioulida
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kea/#ioulida-pentecost-panigiri-ioulida
END:VEVENT
