BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kea-poisses-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-poisses-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration\, Poisses
LOCATION:Poisses\, Kea (Tzia)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The west-coast valley of Poisses celebrates its Sotiras church on 6 August from 20:00\, organised by the municipality and the Poisses society 'Agios Isidoros': liturgy\, then food\, wine and live island music by the beach. It's a long drive from the port on the west-coast road — allow 30 minutes and don't rush back in the dark.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kea/#poisses-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-poisses
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kea/#poisses-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-poisses
END:VEVENT
