BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kea-ioulida-tziotiko-panigiri-of-the-dormition-ioulida-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Tziotiko panigiri of the Dormition\, Ioulida
LOCATION:Ioulida\, Kea (Tzia)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Kea's big night: on 15 August from 21:00 the municipality throws the 'Traditional Tziotiko Panigiri' in the main square of Ioulida\, with a full island orchestra\, communal tables and dancing that goes on until the small hours. The next evening (16 Aug\, 20:00) the party moves to Kato Meria for the 'Glenti Kato Merias' organised with the Karthaia society. Ioulida is on foot only — expect a long walk from wherever you find parking.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kea/#ioulida-tziotiko-panigiri-of-the-dormition-ioulida
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kea/#ioulida-tziotiko-panigiri-of-the-dormition-ioulida
END:VEVENT
